  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>Футуристический дом</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>«Футуристический дом» — это творческий проект с нуля, в рамках которого создаётся дом в футуристическом стиле. </span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Вокруг него возведены здания для развития персонажей, включая наш дом, несколько фермерских участков, стены и большой летающий корабль.</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span>Карта</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_58c2c91c-487a-4c02-b104-a88cec9909d2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_62c7b7c2-f8d4-43f7-8c23-36dea050e2f3.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f2cf4ddf-c584-485a-8393-a5200dcb2b5f.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_38c8d873-776e-416f-856b-3e6367409350.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_319de892-a67f-477d-bed3-de62f4fd97e4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6b2ed1e9-f20a-4bc3-b5e9-eacc723238e6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2011b61b-2fe2-4256-85f0-7ac21c613178.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e6c49ed-a31f-405e-83d3-6a41659e037d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f55271f0-8989-446a-a7c5-b7f069ef7d60.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b934d7e0-1986-483e-ab28-ba67e00ed77a.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bfc8425-b83b-495d-8b75-095f32e737da.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f86249de-3125-4a4b-a315-a23cf4bf0548.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
